{title:Title}

{phang}
{bf:equipop_knn} {hline 2} former name of {help equipop} (EquiPop 1.63.1)

{title:Description}

{pstd}{cmd:equipop_knn} was the command's name up to EquiPop 1.34. It still works, so do-files written then run unchanged: it passes everything, untouched, to {help equipop}, where the syntax, the options and the results are described.{p_end}

